  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power Generation Sector Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana Power Compact - Power Generation Sector Improvement Project: The project was intended to support measures aimed at opening up the power sector and making it attractive to private investment in order to reach the Government of Ghana&apos;s goals to have adequate installed generation capacity to meet demand. After rationalizing the project with other donor programs and existing commercial arrangements, the project was cancelled to reduce redundancy and unnecessary expense. This project was used in the past for accounting purposes but it is not currently an active project for the program. It has no funds either committed or disbursed against it.</narrative>
  </description>
